  9   4010              ; The picture of figure 21.1 in this mode. The registers first, with the
 10   4010              ; display off; then the whole VRAM filled with noise; then the mode's tables,
 11   4010              ; and nothing else; then the display on.
 12   4010 F3           init:   di
 13   4011 31 80 F3             ld sp, SYS_AREA
 14   4014                      VDP_REG 1, $90          ; 16 KB, M1: text mode, display off
 14   4014 3E 90       >        ld a, $90
